-- sqrt 5260294500220744 = s/2^27 + a tail near 2^-82, s odd (s^2 + 15 = m * 2^54, s = 1 mod 4): the 34 bits
-- below the result end 1 0...0, so only the remainder of `isqrt` rounds it up (hardware: ...813)
#guard bothValue (progOf pFSqrt) [4842126294296133448] "4724639673638920813"
#guard bothValue (progOf pFFloor) [4609434218613702656] "4607182418800017408"
